{"id":"5877","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5877_main_stratus-translucidus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>层云通常是灰色云层，云底相当均匀，它可带来毛毛雨、雪或米雪。在本图中，雾正上升进入相当巨大的层云块，可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">该云特有的灰色</span>。层云<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">整体很薄，可显露出太阳的位置</span>，云的轮廓清晰，这可确定为透光云类。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，维多利亚州，布罗德梅多斯","latitude":"纬度: 37° 41' 24'' S","longitude":"经度: 144° 56' 51'' E","date":"25 June 2005 0935 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 6, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.8.4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.8.4"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5877_syn_stratus-translucidus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>0000 UTC气压分析显示出以澳大利亚塔斯马尼亚州为中心的1035 hPa反气旋。图片拍摄位置（以红箭头表示）接近这个高压单体中心。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2005，澳大利亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5877_upper_stratus-translucidus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>在澳大利亚维多利亚州墨尔本机场附近（WMO 94866）的探测中，我们可看到浅辐射逆温残余，在其之下有雾形成，并可看到雾正在上升进入照片中的层云块。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}